{"kind":"table","sheet":"README","address":"A1:B12","rows":12,"cols":2,"values":[["SDS188 A1S2 2026 — Excel Practice Companion",null],[null,null],["Purpose: altered-number Excel execution drills matched to the STRUCTURE of the 2026 A1S2 practice test. This is not an official Stellenbosch workbook and contains no assessment answers.",null],[null,null],["Sheet","Use"],["Bootstrap_Practice","Build 200 resample means from the supplied with-replacement resamples; use the HTML for the training-only boundary rule and answer validator."],["Calls_Practice","Use raw call-answer times for an upper-tail one-sample mean test with known population sigma; the HTML supplies the hypotheses, alpha, and power scenario."],["Rule","Numerical answers in the HTML A1S2 mode are entered to exactly four decimals, with a full stop and no units."],["Important","The real 2026 practice test uses A1PTData.xlsx. This companion uses different data so that practice is not memorisation."],["Bootstrap caveat","The real practice-test text does not reveal the exact lecturer convention for extracting 95% limits from 250 resamples. The HTML therefore labels its 200-resample cut-tail rule as a training convention, not an official 2026 procedure."],["Workbook discipline","Do the calculation in Excel first. Return to the HTML only to enter/check the answer."],["No solutions here","Correct answers and diagnostic feedback live in the HTML, not in this workbook."]]}
